# Skills: DevOps

Purpose:
  DevOps skills for SDDRA system. These skills define how the system
  is built, tested, deployed, and maintained. All DevOps practices
  are encoded as immutable skills.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @git/INDEX.sdd
   3  @ci-cd/INDEX.sdd
   4  @security/INDEX.sdd
   5  @testing/INDEX.sdd
   6  @vercel-optimize/INDEX.sdd

Rules:
  [D1] All git operations MUST follow semantic commits.
  [D2] All commits MUST pass pre-commit hooks.
  [D3] All code MUST pass local validation before push.
  [D4] All security tests MUST pass before merge.
  [D5] All changes MUST be traceable to decisions.
  [D6] .sdd/ changes require owner approval.
  [D7] project/ changes require human review.
  [D8] Production deployments require human approval.

Navigation:
  Git: @git/INDEX.sdd
  CiCd: @ci-cd/INDEX.sdd
  Security: @security/INDEX.sdd
  Testing: @testing/INDEX.sdd
  SemanticCommits: @git/semantic-commits.sdd
  Branching: @git/branching.sdd
  Hooks: @git/hooks.sdd
  Pipeline: @ci-cd/pipeline.sdd
  LocalValidation: @ci-cd/local-validation.sdd
  SecurityTesting: @security/scanners.sdd
  TestAutomation: @testing/automation.sdd
  VercelOptimize: @vercel-optimize/INDEX.sdd

State: +
